# Mirrors assertConfig() in the chatbot's src/config/env.ts and the old REQUIRED_SECRETS.
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY replaced OPENAI_API_KEY on 2026-09-17 (METNMAT-chatbot PR #2): the
# bot's chat models run on DeepSeek, the same account the Command Center uses.
# Re-apply with bootstrap-host.yml only AFTER the key is in metnmat/chat/env, or the
# fetcher will refuse to start the unit.
MONGODB_URI
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY
AGENT_API_KEY
JWT_SECRET
